# Agent checklist

Do not start coding until "Before work" is done. Do not call the task done until "Before handoff" is done.

## 1. Before work

- [ ] Read the relevant parts of `project_TZ.txt`, `structure.md`, `limits.md`
- [ ] Decide the stage: **MVP** or **post-MVP** — do not pull in the next stage
- [ ] Find existing files/patterns in the same area (no duplicates)
- [ ] List files that will change; new folders only if they match `architecture`
- [ ] If the task uses an external API or AI — record fallback and limits

## 2. During implementation

- [ ] Types from the data model (`User`, `UserProfile`, `Food`, `Meal`, …)
- [ ] Server state → TanStack Query; UI state → Pinia
- [ ] Forms → Regle; copy → vue-i18n (`uk` + `en`)
- [ ] Async: loading / disabled / error / success
- [ ] No secrets in the client; user data only through RLS
- [ ] Mobile-first; colors only via theme tokens
- [ ] Never call Gemini from `src/services`
- [ ] No `//` comments; JSDoc on exports; types in TypeScript not in JSDoc
- [ ] Vue SFC: `<template>` then `<script setup>`; styles in `src/styles/views|components`, not in the SFC
- [ ] SVG icons/illustrations in `src/assets/` (not large inline markup); theme colors via `var(--color-*)`
- [ ] Repeated logic extracted; no magic values — reuse `src/constants/`

## 3. Before handoff

- [ ] Behavior matches the spec for this feature, no extra scope
- [ ] Both languages, loading/error, empty state if there is a list
- [ ] If DB — RLS; if external API — debounce/cache/fallback
- [ ] If AI — estimate + editable before save; key on the server
- [ ] Neighbor screens that read the same data still work
- [ ] No leftover `//` comments; exported APIs have JSDoc; no duplicated logic; literals in constants or i18n
- [ ] No `<style>` in Vue files; CSS lives under `src/styles/` named after the route or component
- [ ] New/changed SVG lives under `src/assets/` and uses theme tokens for color when themed
- [ ] Verify the main user path in the browser (or the closest substitute)

## 4. Stop signs (ask, do not invent)

A separate backend, paid services, libraries outside the stack, medical advice, Zod/VeeValidate, Gemini from Vue, other users' data.
